      "updated": 1791003384674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Un registro de plaza.orders\n\nclave   3f1c1d2e-…  (el id del pedido)\n\nce_id            6f1c1d2e-…\nce_specversion   1.0\nce_type          pe.edu.nova.plaza.order.confirmed.v1\nce_source        /plaza/orders\nce_subject       3f1c1d2e-…\nce_time          2026-10-02T15:00:01.123456Z\nce_traceparent   00-4bf9…-01, y traceparent\ncontent-type     application/json\n\nvalor   {\"orderId\": …, \"currency\": \"PEN\", \"total\": 100.90,\n         \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"MUG-001\", \"quantity\": 2, …}]}",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rec",
      "originalText": "Un registro de plaza.orders\n\nclave   3f1c1d2e-…  (el id del pedido)\n\nce_id            6f1c1d2e-…\nce_specversion   1.0\nce_type          pe.edu.nova.plaza.order.confirmed.v1\nce_source        /plaza/orders\nce_subject       3f1c1d2e-…\nce_time          2026-10-02T15:00:01.123456Z\nce_traceparent   00-4bf9…-01, y traceparent\ncontent-type     application/json\n\nvalor   {\"orderId\": …, \"currency\": \"PEN\", \"total\": 100.90,\n         \"items\": [{\"sku\": \"MUG-001\", \"quantity\": 2, …}]}",
